---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Container from '../../components/Container.astro';
import PageHeader from '../../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Brain Science is retired"
  description="I retired the name. These pages count the writing in this repo. They were never brain science."
  path="/brain-science"
  robots="noindex, follow"
  structuredDataType="website"
>
  <Container padding="none" class="px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="origin-note">
      <PageHeader title="Brain Science is retired" />

      <div class="origin-note__body">
        <p>
          I used to call this Brain Science. I liked how serious it sounded, like I was measuring
          something real about my own head. It wasn't rigorous enough for that name. What I built is
          counts over the Markdown I publish here: dates, tags, hits against word lists I keep in
          the repo. Number science, if you need a name. Not psychology. Not a test.
        </p>
        <p>
          The goal was to understand myself better. Same reason I write the rest of this site. I
          still look at the charts. They have almost never been where I actually understood
          anything.
        </p>
        <p>
          That happens in the gap between what I do, what I feel, and what I write. That's the gold
          mine. The numbers are scaffolding. Useful the way a calendar is useful. Not the work.
        </p>
        <p>
          The pages are now called Writing Insights. Work in progress. If you still want to look:
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="origin-note__cta">
        <a href="/writing-insights" class="btn-accent origin-note__button">Writing Insights</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .origin-note {
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .origin-note__body {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgb(var(--color-text));
  }

  .origin-note__body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.15rem;
  }

  .origin-note__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .origin-note__cta {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
  }

  .origin-note__button {
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .origin-note__button:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid rgb(var(--color-accent));
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
